The modifications add NULL checks for all pointer parameters in both functions. The conditions will evaluate to true only when invalid pointers are passed, triggering the bug condition. This covers cases where:
1. The element to add is NULL
2. The head list is NULL
3. The head's prev pointer is NULL (invalid list state)
4. Any of the pointers in __list_add are NULL
